      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sim-to-sim policy rollout costs while varying key MPPI hyperparameters in both MuJoCo (blue) and Gazebo (red) simulation environments. The",
      "bbox": [
        83.21837615966797,
        199.9032745361328,
        557.997314453125,
        207.02854919433594
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "means and standard deviations are computed from 10 different random seeds for each setting. Black dotted lines denote the default parameters we deploy",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        208.74176025390625,
        557.9970092773438,
        215.9945526123047
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "on hardware.",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        217.8362579345703,
        96.32122802734375,
        224.96153259277344
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "of a good estimate of the cost-to-go. For standard MPC",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        234.70233154296875,
        298.8009948730469,
        243.60888671875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "algorithms, longer prediction horizons are generally preferred",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        246.6573486328125,
        298.8009948730469,
        255.56390380859375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "as they often replace the need for an accurate cost-to-",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        258.61236572265625,
        298.801025390625,
        267.5189208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "go estimate. Surprisingly, we find that the MPPI policy",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        270.5673828125,
        298.80096435546875,
        279.47393798828125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "performs best with a 40 −50 timestep horizon (Fig 7). We",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
        281.8060607910156,
        298.79925537109375,
        291.429931640625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "hypothesize that the fixed number of samples prevents our",
      "bbox": [
        53.99999237060547,
        294.4783630371094,
        298.8009338378906,
        303.3849182128906
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "MPPI policy from sufficiently exploring the longer-horizon",
      "bbox": [
        53.99999237060547,
        306.433349609375,
        298.8009033203125,
        315.33990478515625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "planning problem, leading to poor performance.",
      "bbox": [
