        250.17352294921875,
        327.2948913574219
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "5) Number samples: Generally, more samples are pre-",
      "bbox": [
        63.96299362182617,
        331.12432861328125,
        298.7961120605469,
        340.0308837890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ferred in sampling-based optimization algorithms, usually",
      "bbox": [
        53.99998474121094,
        343.0793151855469,
        298.8009948730469,
        351.9858703613281
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "at the expense of more computation. To our surprise, the",
      "bbox": [
        53.99998474121094,
        355.0353088378906,
        298.8009338378906,
        363.9418640136719
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "cost plateaus at ∼40 samples for the quadruped walking",
